The starting code (version 0)
File R/analysis.R:
addcols &lt;- function(d,a,b){
  if(nrow(d)==0){stop("empty")}
  total=d[[a]]+d[[b]]
  positive &lt;- ifelse(total&gt;0,T,F)
  result=list(total=total, positive=positive)
  return(result)
}
Problems: naming, spacing, = vs &lt;-, T/F, no docs, no tests.

